<title>GERMANY: Dresdner to issue 1.5 bln dmk warrant bond.</title>
<headline>Dresdner to issue 1.5 bln dmk warrant bond.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dresdner Bank AG, Germany's second-biggest bank, said on Wednesday it will offer its shareholders a 1.5 billion mark warrant bond in mid-April.</p>
<p>Dresdner said in a statement it was for the first time issuing a warrant bond with subscription rights. The subscription offer and terms of the issue will be published at the start of April.</p>
<p>The bond will be issued via Dresdner's Amsterdam-based subsidiary Dresdner Finance B.V.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
